{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500623-ask-a-simple-question-fallen-world-edition","id":1500623,"title":"Ask a simple question: Fallen World edition","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-01-18T10:56:18-08:00","id":1500623,"title":"Ask a simple question: Fallen World edition","content":"As per <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1500621-ask-a-simple-question-post-closure-and-what-to-do-about-it?p=1500622#post1500622\">Ian\u2019s advice</a>, I\u2019m creating a similar thread as to the now closed <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/114668-ask-a-simple-question-awakened-edition\">ask a simple question thread</a>. <br /> <br /> To restart with, what practice would it be to have a spell act like a massless rope or thread for those example physics problems?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-18T13:23:45-08:00","id":1500645,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1500623-ask-a-simple-question-fallen-world-edition#post1500623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To restart with, what practice would it be to have a spell act like a massless rope or thread for those example physics problems?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, need some context. Can you give an example of these physics problems?<br /> <br /> Without context though, it sounds like <u>Telekinesis </u> or <u>Levitation</u>\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-18T13:41:34-08:00","id":1500647,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://www.google.com/imgres?imgurl=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn1.byjus.com%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F04%2FPulley-Problems-3.png&amp;imgrefurl=https%3A%2F%2Fbyjus.com%2Fjee%2Fpulley-problems%2F&amp;tbnid=aKMtG-hUe6LXTM&amp;vet=12ahUKEwjS_KraiNL8AhUYxMkDHa2gB70QMygGegUIARDeAQ..i&amp;docid=JigK7uoIzpwJUM&amp;w=750&amp;h=494&amp;q=pulley%20problems%20physics&amp;hl=en-us&amp;client=safari&amp;ved=2ahUKEwjS_KraiNL8AhUYxMkDHa2gB70QMygGegUIARDeAQ\" target=\"_blank\"><img title=\"dataurl539633.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1075_1674077540309_721\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1075\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1075\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1075&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"dataurl539633.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/> </a> \u200b<img title=\"image.png\" data-tempid=\"temp_1076_1674077595031_638\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1076\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1076\" data-thumb-url=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=1076&amp;type=thumb\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"image.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-need-data-att-update js-lightbox-participant\" itemprop=\"image\"/>\u200b<br /> These problems are what I meant. In basic physics, you are supposed to not care about the friction, mass or any number of properties of a rope that would need to be accounted for in real life. Basically, I\u2019m asking about a spell that connects two objects and make them act on each other as if they were connected by a rope. It would be useful for traps, spider man style swinging, and much more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a hre