pell, triggering a autosacifice blowing up to try kill another Mages, then he addresses an audience of ordinary Mages in the Adamantine Arrow commons.<br /> What do you think about the result of the speech?<br /> Me as a storyteller call for a social test and build a scene according to result. But ignore and just write down what comes to your mind as result of the actions. Pretty please!</div> </div> </div> </div>I am not sure I understand. You mean he is a recovering Scelestus and he is warning others about the danger and horror of the Abyss ?<br /> <br /> Give it some Doors, reduce them for personal or emotional arguments. It probably will be a loe amount of Doors, since the view &quot;don't mess with the Abyss because it never ends well&quot; is a standard and accepted part of Awakened culture. What you are aiming for is increase the chances those doing so stop, in an empathetic appeal of &quot;I suffered, another innocent died, this could happen to you, don't make the same mistake as I did.<br /> <br /> Positive results include those delving into Abyssal lore confessing or their cabal asking for help, befoulers with an addiction coming forward, radicals weaponizing the Abyss or experimenting with it reconsidering, Councilors creating policies based on that, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-